cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "TB Fractional SEIT Brazil: code, data and frozen evidence for within-family and external forecast skill in SEIT tuberculosis models"
abstract: >-
  Code, supplied monthly tuberculosis series for Brazil (2001-2022, N = 264), and frozen evidence
  (S1 freeze, ordinary monthly observation operator) for a methodological comparison of a
  fractional-order and an integer-order SEIT model against persistence, seasonal naive and SARIMA
  baselines in a rolling-origin evaluation (13 origins, horizons 1-12 months).
authors:
